{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/dbdbd488d4c43a2618d124256f191007.avif?t=1768820009\" width=920 height=430 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Imagine waking up on an island shore.</strong></u> You have no belongings and no idea where you are. As you start to explore, you encounter friendly villagers, help with repairs, embark on new adventures and create your own comfortable farm, decorated just the way you like. These achievements, however, will require some hard work on your part and firstly you must introduce yourself to the locals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/bb93b99a1c2e610da280a915c7068608.webp?t=1768820009\" width=46 height=51 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/8a1db28ef29ea91af446bfbcfee866bd.webp?t=1768820009\" width=57 height=61 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/ec398c116e73fab08f19e55c8f45d38e.webp?t=1768820009\" width=53 height=50 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/495eac51ea3189342555a567e147d748.webp?t=1768820009\" width=55 height=55 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/f965dab1fcda3e2282ef4a5e760e98bd.webp?t=1768820009\" width=52 height=48 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/bf7138ab26e5499b0458dc80b6747420.webp?t=1768820009\" width=57 height=56 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/6270d4528d640185671d8c259741e2cd.webp?t=1768820009\" width=49 height=51 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/27dba36bc513399ffb94f03b56cb71c2.webp?t=1768820009\" width=56 height=55 /></span>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/61d9a4cb6a6f40e8a40dd070dc0f4942.webp?t=1768820009\" width=53 height=53 /></span>\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Meet the Villagers</strong></u><strong> </strong>\u2013 Introduce yourself to the community and you will reap the rewards. They are a friendly bunch who will welcome you enthusiastically into their small village. Each villager has their own daily schedule and you will learn where they usually like to hang out. Will they be in the coffee shop, arcade, or even shopping for new furniture? Engage in fun conversations and enjoy the cut scenes that are rewarded for increasing friendship levels.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/14aa65c2787ece7ba6cc05849405c728.avif?t=1768820009\" width=1277 height=1017 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Decorate your farm</strong></u><strong> </strong>\u2013 Your small, empty farmhouse will need to be decorated, luckily there is a furniture shop in the village. Stocking all the latest fashions in many different colours and styles, there is something to suit everyone. The only problem you will encounter here is how to fit all your favourite pieces into your house \u2013 maybe you should visit Leslie and ask him to make your house a bit bigger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/be5a88b0633370fcb65e6e4fb40fd136.avif?t=1768820009\" width=909 height=656 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But don\u2019t forget the garden, the local garden centre will stock everything you need to make your garden, beautiful, relaxing and productive.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/df54e19ad1251a31229b43905407952b.avif?t=1768820009\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Repair buildings</u></strong> \u2013 A couple of the local buildings have become run-down and need some repairs. Will you help to collect the resources required to restore these buildings? Collect resources around the town and driftwood washed up onto the beach, or maybe you could talk to Trevor at the recycle plant to see if he can help you out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/e7c2381afc3666dc56d61bb275146bca.avif?t=1768820009\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Catch bugs and fish</strong></u><strong> </strong>\u2013 So many interesting bugs and fish can be found on the island. Will you be able to catch them all to complete your journal? Fish and bugs will only appear at certain dates and times so you will need to be organised if you want to catch them all. But don\u2019t be concerned, none of these creatures are harmed, they can be sold to Clemmie to help with the conservation effort.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/338391e1ddc0633f91c52b34e33c8e41.avif?t=1768820009\" width=867 height=653 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Go Mining for treasure</strong></u> \u2013 The network of caves is dark and dangerous, who knows what you might encounter in there. There are many treasures and riches waiting to be discovered, but it\u2019s not going to be that easy!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/extras/98f85338f2d39e855b63871c846fabea.webp?t=1768820009\" width=19 height=50 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Music</strong></u><strong> </strong>\u2013<strong> </strong>An original soundtrack adds atmosphere to the game. You can enjoy calming, cheerful, or even eerie music to suit the environment, all composed by our team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All of these features will be available straight away in early access but there is so much more to be added so please follow us for updates. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3722340?t=1768820009","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3722340/f5bcef0987f6e30c069caf3a1a021ea3a3b418ed/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768820009","capsule_image":"https://s